15. Runtime Consideration

Accuracy is not the only factor that should be considered.

A more accurate CNN model may require more computational resources and more time to run. A faster model with slightly lower accuracy may still be useful if its results are good enough for the purpose of the application.

Therefore, the model selection should consider both:

Accuracy
+
Runtime

For the project results provided, VGG is the best overall architecture because it performs particularly well on both main objectives.

However, if processing speed were more important than the highest possible breed accuracy, another architecture could be considered if its results were accurate enough for the application.
